//@version=6
// impl-07 §4.3.2 probe (ours): a daily sub-program that itself requests the 4-h close, and the same
// 4-h request at the top level — one key, one instance (P4); the child is stepped before its parent.
strategy("htf nested")
inner() => request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "240", close)
d = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", inner())
h = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "240", close)
plot(d)
plot(h)
